+"""One bounded, private learnability probe; not production worker assembly.
+
+Run from the outer packet with:
+  WORK/.venv/bin/python review.py run --receipt checks/cfd0943c5b14/peer-command.json \
+    python3 generators/cfd0943c5b14/workspace/learnability_probe.py
